{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat collab/1793110000000-engineer-8f3d.prompt.md'","aggregated_output":"Created-GMT: 2026-10-15 12:20:00 GMT\nCreated-Local: 2026-10-15 19:20:00 +07\nCoding-Agent: codex\nSession-ID: pending (provider-generated)\n# Task: 8f-3 fix round 3: NaN-reflexive item 13 and store-image (Architect ruling), uncommitted on top of committed 7b8d2a93\nRole: VM Runtime\nImplementers:\n- Model: gpt-6.1-sol | Assigned: 2026-10-15 19:20 +07 | Status: active | Rationale: same slice; Node and Dart lanes failed two NaN tests on the register kernel; Architect ruled the fix\n\nWorktree /Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-p8f3 (branch srvm-phase8f3 @ 7b8d2a93 committed, clean). Read ./collab/1792057828000-architect-8f3-nan-ruling.report.md and EXECUTE its section 6 steps 1-4 and 6 EXACTLY (F1 tuple= in src/cljc/yin/vm/semantic_register/code.cljc lines ~815/820 with the dao.jing.cbor require; F2 store-image compares :address in src/cljc/yin/vm/semantic_register.cljc ~281; T1 in code_test.cljc; T2 in semantic_engine_test.cljc; one clause in docs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.md section 3.4 item 13 saying tuple equality is content equality: this single doc clause is authorised by the ruling, no other doc edit). Verify the refusal-row pcs of T1 by running them; pin what well-formed? returns on the JVM. NOT you: Node/Dart lanes (the orchestrator runs them), frame.cljc free-env (ledgered). Prove T1/T2 would have caught the bug: mutate (restore host = in tuple= / store-image), watch the new tests fail on the JVM where they can (T2 content-equal reload fails on the JVM today), restore byte-for-byte. No commit/stage. Foreground lanes: kondo on changed files; clojure -M:test -e :slow -n yin.vm.semantic-register.code-test -n yin.vm.semantic-engine-test -n yang.python.antlr.int-ops-test -n yin.vm.semantic-register.vm-test; then the whole JVM quick tier `clojure -M:test -e :slow` (loopback/network may need approval). Report ./collab/<ms>-engineer-8f3d.report.md with Completed-GMT/Completed-Local/Coding-Agent/Session-ID, exact diffs, counts, mutant results, truthful. End READY or BLOCKED.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
